-- The high-speed CFrame mover does not need Roblox's PlayerModule disabled.
-- Disabling it as soon as a saved Auto-Steal toggle loaded made the character
-- feel anchored while the hub was only scanning/waiting for a target. Always
-- keep normal movement controls enabled; the mover still owns each CFrame
